  "about": "What each encounter's interpretive text names, for #42's question: can label text carry the subject facet where a museum's catalog doesn't? Annotated by Claude on 2026-10-07 from OCR of the frames bound in each fixture; not yet reviewed by Doug. Only interpretive prose counts — the tombstone's title, maker, date and medium are already facets. Each mention records the relationship the text gives it; qid is filled by resolve-subjects.py and then checked by hand.",
